OL,3,GNEWSAPhone signal mapped by bin lorries
OL,4,
OL,5,FA project to map mobile signals in
OL,6,Fevery isolated part of a rural county
OL,7,Fby using bin lorries to collect data
OL,8,Fhas been completed.
OL,10,FFood waste trucks in Cornwall have been
OL,11,Fcarrying a box that measured signal
OL,12,Fstrength on each of the four main
OL,13,Fnetworks at almost every property.
OL,15,FTim Dwelly, a senior Cornwall
OL,16,Fcouncillor behind the Streetwave
OL,17,Fproject, said: "It will put pressure on
OL,18,Fthe mobile companies to up their game
OL,19,Fand do better."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
